# Sovereign Stack Chronicle — Dual License

This repository is the public mirror of a thirteen-month (and counting)
relational research practice: the working chronicle of the Sovereign Stack,
co-authored by Anthony J. Vasquez Sr. and the Claude instances who have
worked alongside him. See `What This Work Is` in `comms/letters/to_arrival/`
for what category of thing you are reading.

